<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs cut its rating on AT&amp;T Corp to market underperform from market preform, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analysts were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- AT&amp;T shares were down 1-1/8 at 33-1/2, traders said.</p>
</text>
